      "Across all 238 returns compute the population mean, population second centered moment m2, and population third centered moment m3.",
      "Compute m3 divided by m2 to the power 3/2. Require finite strictly positive m2; a zero-variance stock-day remains missing.",
      "Require a finite result. Do not apply Fisher finite-sample correction, clipping, winsorization, imputation, sign splitting, amount weighting, rank transformation, or daily substitution."
