    "formula": "m3 / m2^(3/2), mean_r = Sum(r_hj)/238, m2 = Sum((r_hj-mean_r)^2)/238, m3 = Sum((r_hj-mean_r)^3)/238, r_hj = log(close_hj/close_h,j-1), h in {morning,afternoon}, j=2..120",
